1
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,080
You're awake.

2
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:47,940
How do you feel?

3
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:55,820
Do you have something to say to me?

4
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:00,320
I want to say I'm fine.

5
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,890
You don't need to worry.

6
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,200
When I recover,

7
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:09,039
can you tell me

8
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:11,720
the story of you and Miss Tang?

9
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,360
You killed her.

10
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,600
But I really didn't mean it.

11
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:46,520
Let me explain.

12
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:50,250
Give me a moment.

13
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,240
How dare you, Yuwen Jingxuan.

14
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:09,440
You really are cunning.

15
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,920
Please calm down, Your Highness.

16
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:14,600
Why not use our spies to poison them again, or...

17
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:19,440
Speak.

18
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:22,640
Dying at the hands of a lover,

19
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:26,400
or killing the one you love,

20
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,440
which is more painful?

21
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:40,010
If what Yuwen Jingxuan said is true...

22
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,840
She is me,

23
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,600
and I am her.

24
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,159
Then why was she killed

25
00:04:46,159 --> 00:04:47,480
while I am still alive?

26
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:51,640
Can he foresee the future?

27
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:53,800
But,

28
00:04:54,159 --> 00:04:57,240
I've definitely had this birthmark since I was born.

29
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,159
It can't be faked.

30
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,720
No.

31
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,820
I still need to go and ask him for clarification.

32
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:37,120
Guards!

33
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:37,980
Your Highness.

34
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:41,240
Make sure to hand this to Eldest Young Master Su personally.

35
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:41,800
Yes.

36
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,730
Are you alright, Miss Tang?

37
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,480
It was dangerous here just now.

38
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,480
I had no choice but to do this.

39
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:20,240
Dangerous?

40
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,320
At this point,

41
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:26,290
I can no longer keep it from you, Miss Tang.

42
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:30,360
Actually, you and the Miss Tang my sixth brother mentioned

43
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,890
are indeed the same person.

44
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,440
The reason why

45
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:35,880
I repeatedly asked you to leave

46
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:39,400
is because I fear history will repeat itself.

47
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,480
History

48
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,760
repeating itself?

49
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,659
You might have forgotten, Miss Tang.

50
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:48,480
My sixth brother has been lonely since childhood.

51
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,240
He is extreme and paranoid.

52
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:55,500
Last time, just because of a trivial matter,

53
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:58,200
he killed that girl.

54
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,650
Now, as for Prince Shuo's Mansion,

55
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,400
you can't go back.

56
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:09,300
Why don't I escort you out of the city, Miss Tang?

57
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,160
The world is vast,

58
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,820
and the martial world is wide.

59
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,780
There must be a way out for you.

60
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:20,320
But since I helped you fake your death last time,

61
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:23,080
I'm afraid once you disappear,

62
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,650
I'll be the first one they suspect.

63
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:30,120
Then what should we do?

64
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:36,200
Why don't we go all the way

65
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,800
and kill him?

66
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:40,760
Miss Tang.

67
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:42,280
Don't worry.

68
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:45,440
I will definitely help you clean up the mess.

69
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,520
No one will find out it was you.

70
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,680
Miss Tang,

71
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,360
you ended up like this today

72
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,800
all because of Yuwen Jingxuan.

73
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:59,540
If you don't kill him with your own hands,

74
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,850
are you going to wait

75
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:02,880
for him to kill you again?

76
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:10,680
Fine.

77
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,440
Since Miss Tang is so deeply in love,

78
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:18,320
I, as an outsider, will say no more.

79
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,570
Please leave, Miss.

80
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:24,140
Next year during the Qingming Festival,

81
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:26,640
I will burn a stick of incense for you.

82
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,080
Tang Zhiluo,

83
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,039
kill Yuwen Jingxuan.

84
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:41,039
Kill him.

85
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,679
Kill Yuwen Jingxuan.

86
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:48,520
Kill Yuwen Jingxuan.

87
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:50,560
Yuwen Jingxuan.

88
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:58,720
Kill Yuwen Jingxuan.

89
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,480
Miss Aduo,

90
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,680
we just met by chance.

91
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,920
Why do you keep following me?

92
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:05,040
It's been three days and three nights.

93
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:06,040
Aren't you tired?

94
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,960
Give me the jade thumb ring in your purse,

95
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,560
and I'll stop following you.

96
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:11,200
That won't do.

97
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,440
Why not?

98
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:15,560
That jade thumb ring is the token of the Su family's matriarch.

99
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,520
How can it be given to just anyone?

100
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:17,640
Isn't that perfect?

101
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:19,240
I'm going to marry you anyway.

102
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,240
It's all the same.

103
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:22,120
How can you say such things so casually?

104
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,400
Well, in the frontier...

105
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:24,800
This is not the frontier.

106
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:26,880
But I am from the frontier.

107
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,200
I don't care.

108
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,600
I am going to marry you.

109
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,040
Forget it.

110
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,600
It's getting late.

111
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,690
Let's find an inn for the night.

112
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,280
Walk slower.

113
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:38,040
Hey.

114
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,360
Too fast.

115
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:50,320
Mr. Su, this is a letter from the prince.

116
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,960
Keep an eye on the girl next door.

117
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,690
Don't let her find out I'm gone.

118
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,080
Jingxuan.

119
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,760
You must hold on until I get back.
